### 변수 설정
@hostname = localhost
@port = 8080
@baseUrl = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api

### 1. 방 생성 (방장 A)
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "방장A",
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.9780,
  "mapRadius": 300,
  "prisonRadius": 10,
  "timeLimit": 600,
  "runawayLimit": 120
}

### 방 생성 응답에서 roomId와 hostId를 변수로 저장 (IntelliJ 기능)
@roomId = 1
@roomCode = 88BG68
@playerId = 1
@hostId = 1

### 2. 방 참가 (참여자 B)
# @name joinRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "{{roomCode}}",
  "nickname": "참여자B"
}

### 방 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}?playerId={{playerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 팀 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/players/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": {{playerId}},
  "role": "POLICE"
}

### 준비 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/players/ready
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": {{playerId}},
  "isReady": true
}

### 게임 시작
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": {{hostId}}
}